#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:376
msgid ""
"Only one datastore may be configured as the heartbeat target at a time. "
"If multiple datastores are marked as heartbeat targets, |morpheus| will "
"automatically select one (preferring provisioned, non-failing datastores)"
